@startuml SF07_ChangePassword
title Screen Flow - Change Password (logged in)

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #DAE8FC
  BorderColor #333333
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #FFF2CC
  BorderColor #333333
}
skinparam ArrowColor #444444

rectangle "Dashboard\n(any role)" as Dash
rectangle "My Profile" as Profile
usecase "Change Password Popup" as ChangePw

Dash --> Profile : Click avatar >\n"My Profile"
Profile --> ChangePw : Click "Change\nPassword" button
ChangePw --> ChangePw : Wrong current password /\nweak new password (error)
ChangePw --> Profile : Password changed\nsuccessfully

@enduml
